# coscad outputs: regenerated by `coscad <file>.assemble`, `coscad next`,
# `coscad plan [--png]` and scripts/build-manual.sh; not committed.
# Print records under models/ (the `next` manifest and the `_next_` part
# scenes a print was made from, print-run.json) stay committed.
*_step[0-9]*.png
*_step[0-9]*.scad
*_plan.json
*_plan.md
*_design.json
*_manifest.json
!models/**/*_manifest.json
*_asm.scad
*_plate.scad
*_plate[0-9]*.scad
*_part_*.scad
*_next_*.scad
!models/**/*_next_*.scad
examples-next/bracket_seam.scad
# macOS metadata (AppleDouble) files: `._coscad.cabal` breaks cabal
._*
# Kept on purpose as a reference output (docs/EXAMPLES.md).
!examples-next/greaser-example/greaser_manifest.json
